---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Thanks — we'll be in touch | Teleforce"
  description="Your message reached the Teleforce team. We'll come back with a staffing plan within two business days."
>
  <header class="ahead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cat">Message sent</div>
      <h1>Thanks — we've got it.</h1>
      <div class="ameta"><span>We reply within two business days</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="post">
    <p class="lead">Your message reached the Teleforce team. We'll review your channels and volumes and come back with a staffing plan and a go-live date — usually within two business days.</p>
    <p>In the meantime, you can keep reading on <a href="/blog">Signal</a>, our journal on bilingual and nearshore support, or head back to the <a href="/">home page</a>.</p>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h4>Want to get ahead of the call?</h4>
      <p>Jot down your current channels (voice, chat, email), the languages you serve, and your rough monthly volume — having those handy makes the first conversation faster.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-amber">Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
